    <string name="a11y_summary">Shows the island around the camera hole.</string>
    <string name="a11y_description">Bulle uses accessibility only to draw the island over other apps, to know the foreground app name and the position of windows (to hide the island in full screen or in apps you choose) and to run the gesture actions you set up (back, home, screenshot…). Bulle never reads the content of the screen or windows, and nothing leaves your phone.</string>

